title: Nala soo Xiriir
---

Maqaallada, cilmi-baarista, iyo wixii faallo ah ee ku saabsan Joornaalka, fadlan nagala soo xiriir xafiiska tifaftirka.

### Faahfaahinta Xiriirka:
* **Email:** [journalmft@gmail.com](mailto:journalmft@gmail.com)
* **Website:** [The Journal of Peace and Development](https://journalmft-ux.github.io/The-Journal-of-Peace-and-Developmen/)

### Soo gudbinta Maqaallada:
Haddii aad rabto in maqaal laguugu daabaco Joornaalka, fadlan maqaalkaaga oo dhammaystiran ugu soo dir email-ka kor ku xusan. 

**Xafiiska Tifaftirka ayaa dib kuugu soo jawaabi doona marka la qiimeeyo maqaalkaaga.**
